lation and potential failure cases (Section 4.4).", "Expand the style definitions beyond four categories to test the method's scalability (Section 4.1).", "Add real-world human demonstrations to validate the practical applicability (Section 5)."], "rating": 7, "confidence": 4, "soundness": 3, "presentation": 3, "contribution": 3}

